{
  "name": "Reelsaw shorts 1/2: new YouTube upload → start a project",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "b9240b45-3a3e-4735-ae9f-0d085c129db7",
      "name": "New YouTube upload",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.rssFeedReadTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "pollTimes": {
          "item": [
            {
              "mode": "everyHour"
            }
          ]
        },
        "feedUrl": "https://www.youtube.com/feeds/videos.xml?channel_id=YOUR_CHANNEL_ID"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a612d551-59e5-4d0a-bd41-ef96daa36524",
      "name": "Test with one video",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        200
      ],
      "parameters": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "8fdeb929-1b97-4d64-b9b7-2cac3e471709",
      "name": "Settings",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        240,
        100
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "74e94103-42d9-4db0-b11b-867aa4929967",
              "name": "reelsawUrl",
              "value": "https://app.reelsaw.com",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "14746795-2261-42e8-ab25-72ae5d686e38",
              "name": "videoUrl",
              "value": "={{ $json.link ?? 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PASTE_A_VIDEO_ID' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "627c5bfb-7a66-4319-a190-06ac513b747b",
              "name": "maxClips",
              "value": 5,
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "c1c9ffda-8161-46d1-b2bf-8fe08e51f354",
              "name": "focus",
              "value": "",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "c6494b6f-f0e6-4ec4-b08e-073243986b11",
              "name": "workflowTag",
              "value": "n8n-shorts",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "1716b63a-8132-43b9-9292-a6bb10c6e90d",
      "name": "Create project",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        480,
        100
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $('Settings').first().json.reelsawUrl.replace(/\\/$/, '') }}/api/mcp",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Accept",
              "value": "application/json, text/event-stream"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ jsonrpc: '2.0', id: 1, method: 'tools/call', params: { name: 'create_project', arguments: { sourceUrl: $json.videoUrl, settings: Object.assign({ maxClips: $json.maxClips }, $json.focus ? { focus: $json.focus } : {}), metadata: { source: 'youtube', videoId: ($json.videoUrl.split('v=')[1] ?? '').split('&')[0], workflow: $json.workflowTag } } } }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 30000
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "098857d8-d354-46cc-b4a1-03e4464328c7",
      "name": "Read project",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        720,
        100
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForEachItem",
        "jsCode": "// MCP tools/call answers { result: { content: [{ type: 'text', text }], isError? } }.\nconst r = $json;\nif (r.error) throw new Error(`Reelsaw MCP error: ${r.error.message}`);\nconst text = r.result?.content?.[0]?.text ?? '';\nif (r.result?.isError) throw new Error(`Reelsaw: ${text}`);\nconst p = JSON.parse(text);\n// The clips arrive at the publish workflow when Reelsaw sends project.done.\nreturn { json: { id: p.id, title: p.title, status: p.status, url: p.url, metadata: p.metadata } };"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "d6cec0c8-3bbb-40da-a8ac-23705a550107",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        -400
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 820,
        "height": 360,
        "content": "## 1/2 New YouTube upload → Reelsaw project\n\nStarts a Reelsaw project for each new upload and ends there. Reelsaw sends `project.done` to the **publish** workflow (2/2) when the clips are rendered, so nothing here waits.\n\n1. API key: Reelsaw **Settings → API keys and MCP**. Add an n8n **Header Auth** credential (name `Authorization`, value `Bearer rs_…`) and pick it in **Create project**.\n2. **Settings**: `reelsawUrl`, `maxClips`, optional `focus`. `workflowTag` goes into the project's `metadata.workflow`; the publish workflow only posts projects with the same tag.\n3. Put your channel id in the RSS trigger (`youtube.com/feeds/videos.xml?channel_id=UC…`), or run **Test with one video**.\n\nn8n not reachable from the internet? Use `reelsaw-youtube-to-shorts.json` (waits with polling) instead."
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "New YouTube upload": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Settings",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Test with one video": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Settings",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Settings": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Create project",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Create project": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Read project",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "active": false,
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "pinData": {}
}
